Modified by the Stratus project (https://github.com/stratus-private-cloud/stratus-backend):
the image and text towers were exported to ONNX separately, quantised to 8-bit
integers (the image tower calibrated on 64 COCO val2017 photographs, the text
tower dynamically, its vocabulary table per row), and converted to the ONNX
Runtime format. tokenizer.bin is the model's tokenizer.json rewritten in a
compact binary form. The recipe is build/embed/model/bundle.py.
